# Backlog Recrutement (MVP + V2)

## Conventions
- `status`: `todo` | `in_progress` | `blocked` | `done`
- `priority`: `P0` (critique) | `P1` (haute) | `P2` (normale)
- `effort`: `S` (1-2 j) | `M` (3-5 j) | `L` (6-10 j)
- `owner`: role responsable principal
- `depends_on`: liste IDs prerequis

## Owners proposes
- `owner_product`: Product Owner RH
- `owner_front`: Lead Frontend
- `owner_back`: Lead Backend
- `owner_data`: Data/BI
- `owner_qa`: QA Lead

